WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,170 --> 00:00:05,210
Senda, what's going on with the hunting tribe? Return to the king.

2
00:00:05,530 --> 00:00:08,630
What needs does the hunting gang tribe also have?

3
00:00:08,870 --> 00:00:10,790
They want us to put our names closer

4
00:00:11,070 --> 00:00:12,430
A place in their hunting tribe

5
00:00:12,430 --> 00:00:14,070
Give them medium-sized iron ore mines

6
00:00:15,380 --> 00:00:17,340
Iron mine? Agreed?

7
00:00:17,700 --> 00:00:18,780
Anyway, these things are temporary

8
00:00:18,780 --> 00:00:20,300
Cannot be converted into existing equipment

9
00:00:20,820 --> 00:00:22,020
But it’s not too late to lose

10
00:00:22,340 --> 00:00:24,060
As much as possible, get it from people from the hunting tribe.

11
00:00:24,060 --> 00:00:26,420
If you have more ammunition and equip it, you can also arm us.

12
00:00:26,420 --> 00:00:27,420
The sons of the Tamu tribe

13
00:00:27,780 --> 00:00:31,060
Reducing their casualties is Emperor Senda

14
00:00:31,460 --> 00:00:32,660
What I asked you to do recently

15
00:00:32,660 --> 00:00:34,500
How are you doing? Return to the king.

16
00:00:34,860 --> 00:00:36,300
The previous harassment plan went well

17
00:00:36,420 --> 00:00:37,780
Most are close to buffer areas

18
00:00:37,780 --> 00:00:39,100
The camp in Omae is unbearable

19
00:00:39,420 --> 00:00:40,820
At first, they chased with all their might

20
00:00:41,020 --> 00:00:42,020
But as time goes by

21
00:00:42,220 --> 00:00:43,820
Found out we were just playing tricks on them

22
00:00:43,980 --> 00:00:44,980
gradually began to slack off

23
00:00:45,220 --> 00:00:46,740
That is, we are entangled with you today.

24
00:00:46,740 --> 00:00:49,020
There's something going on at the camp in Huangsha Town, which has been there for the longest time.

25
00:00:49,180 --> 00:00:50,980
The cavalry team currently sent out

26
00:00:51,180 --> 00:00:52,300
Haven't come back yet

27
00:00:52,660 --> 00:00:53,900
Most likely sacrificed

28
00:00:54,180 --> 00:00:57,060
Huangsha Town Camp is the previous one

29
00:00:57,060 --> 00:01:00,260
The camp with which we have the most intense friction is yes, Your Majesty.
